<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?><document id="167000" schemaversion="1.4" date="2026-09-09T15:02:39+10:00" version="current" level="processed" position="1" publicationid="ebl1-syst-port-3u4v"><documentinfo><uri id="167000" external="false" mediatype="application/vnd.pageseeder.psml+xml" created="2026-09-09T15:02:39+10:00" modified="2026-09-09T15:02:39+10:00" scheme="http" host="pr.localhost" port="80" path="/ps/epub/local1/documents/system_report/components/system_report-09.psml" decodedpath="/ps/epub/local1/documents/system_report/components/system_report-09.psml" title="Business Case"><displaytitle>Business Case</displaytitle></uri><reversexrefs><reversexref uriid="167004" href="../_local/documents/system_report_2/components/requirements.psml" frag="2" urititle="Requirements" mediatype="application/vnd.pageseeder.psml+xml" documenttype="references" id="719596" title="" type="none" forwardtype="embed" forwarddisplay="document" forwardfrag="default"/><reversexref uriid="167013" href="../system_report.psml" frag="content" urititle="System Report" mediatype="application/vnd.pageseeder.psml+xml" documenttype="references" id="719623" title="" type="none" forwardtype="embed" forwardtitle="Business Case" forwarddisplay="document" forwardfrag="default" level="1"/></reversexrefs></documentinfo><fragmentinfo structure-modified="2019-09-10T11:43:43+10:00"><locator id="245896" fragment="167000-1-1" modified="2019-09-16T17:17:52+10:00"/></fragmentinfo><metadata/><section id="167000-title"><fragment id="167000-title"><heading level="1" numbered="true" prefix="2.2" id="167000-1-title-1">Business Case</heading></fragment></section><section id="167000-body"><fragment id="167000-1-1"><para>This section describes the business case for creating the system and could include the following:</para><list><item>The business needs that the system will address.</item><item>The problems that the system will solve.</item><item>Cost-benefit analysis of creating the system application.</item><item>The importance of users, see <xref id="719589" title="{parentnumber}{prefix}" frag="1" reversefrag="1-1" reversetitle="" reverselink="true" reversetype="none" display="template" config="para" type="none" uriid="166976" href="system_report-10.psml" urititle="Functionality" mediatype="application/vnd.pageseeder.psml+xml">2.3.1.(a)</xref> under <xref id="719590" title="{prefix} {heading}" frag="1-2" reversefrag="1-1" reversetitle="" reverselink="true" reversetype="none" display="template" config="numbered-heading" type="none" uriid="166976" href="system_report-10.psml" urititle="Functionality" mediatype="application/vnd.pageseeder.psml+xml">2.3.1 Account</xref>.</item></list><para>The budget for developing the system is $<placeholder name="budget" unresolved="true">20,000</placeholder>.</para></fragment></section></document>